  "slug": "hearty-tofu-lentil-breakfast-plate",
  "name": "Hearty tofu and lentil breakfast plate",
  "description": "A large savoury breakfast: seared firm tofu and warmed cooked lentils over sautéed mushrooms and wilted spinach, with fresh tomato and a little olive oil — sized for a big morning calorie and protein target without leaning on fat.",
  "iconKey": "fork_knife",
  "instructions": [
    "Pat the tofu dry, cut it into thick slabs and sear them in half the olive oil over medium-high heat for 5 minutes, turning once.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and the rest of the olive oil to the pan and cook for 3 minutes, until they colour.",
    "Stir the cooked lentils into the pan with the salt and the black pepper and warm through for 1 minute.",
    "Fold in the spinach off the heat and let it wilt.",
    "Spread the lentils and spinach across a large plate, lay the tofu on top and finish with the chopped tomato."
